C03: a constraint acknowledgement is shaped without the dialogue history (CLOSE1649)

UI1645 and UI1647 measured «No escribas nada en ningún lado.» twice: the raw drafts of the constraint_ack shape answered the welcome greeting kept in the dialogue («Hola, todo bien. ¿Cómo va tu día?», then «{"answer": "ok"}») instead of the constraint, and the turn fell back to a semantic clarification. The acknowledgement is generated from user_constraint alone; readers, audit and topic scoping keep the stored dialogue.

